                        "entry_id": "a547b335-3d2b-330f-a2c6-7f5b40218cd5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Composed of both good and evil."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bf3149e-bd20-4931-862b-cdf68e39d8f4",
                                "sense_id": "5f3f1124-fd31-3914-bbe0-80f9bccff00a",
                                "text": "There may be an opposite fault; for indeed upon the agathokakological globe there are opposite qualities always to be found in parallel degrees, north and south of the equator."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "16500724-fe82-476b-b9e4-e91f8a277400",
                                "sense_id": "5f3f1124-fd31-3914-bbe0-80f9bccff00a",
                                "text": "Just throwing a number out, I'd say he is at least seven or seven and a half feet tall. Not really muscular, just tall, thin, and brooding with something evil, or at the very least an agathokakological sense of being."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2e8b57c-23b9-4f0d-9583-4d8d0fc012ed",
                                "sense_id": "5f3f1124-fd31-3914-bbe0-80f9bccff00a",
                                "text": "When any project dominates your life for a sizeable length of time, let alone the best part of six years, you have to accept the agathokakological nature of the beast."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
